      "published_at": "2026-09-16T07:55:32.000Z",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-09-22T02:25:52.766Z",
      "caption": "𝗛𝗮𝗿𝗶 𝗨𝘀𝗿𝗮𝗵 𝗦𝗮𝗲𝗲𝗱𝗮𝗵 𝗶𝘀 𝗕𝗔𝗖𝗞!\n\nThis year, we're putting mental well-being at the heart of our Family Day, bringing families and the community together to learn, connect and have fun while creating a space where everyone feels supported and cared for.\n\nIn conjunction with 𝗠𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗮𝗹 𝗛𝗲𝗮𝗹𝘁𝗵 𝗔𝘄𝗮𝗿𝗲𝗻𝗲𝘀𝘀 𝗠𝗼𝗻𝘁𝗵 this October, join us for 𝗠𝗶𝗻𝗱𝗙𝗲𝘀𝘁 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟲, a morning filled with meaningful conversations, family activities and plenty of opportunities to connect with one another.\n\n📅 Saturday, 17 October 2026\n🕘 9 AM – 1 PM\n📍 Masjid An-Nur\n\nBring your family, invite your friends and come spend the morning with us! 💚\n\n𝗧𝗼𝗴𝗲𝘁𝗵𝗲𝗿 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗛𝗲𝗮𝗹𝘁𝗵𝘆 𝗠𝗶𝗻𝗱𝘀 & 𝗛𝗮𝗽𝗽𝘆 𝗙𝗮𝗺𝗶𝗹𝗶𝗲𝘀.\n\nSave the date. All are welcome!\n\n#CahayaMenaraBiru\n#MasjidDihatiku\n#HariUsrahSaeedah\n#salamsg\n#HealthyMindsHappyFamilies"
